{"title":"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The graph of the function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> is shown below. How many solutions does the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/8/f282851d0f4f858d95740aaa34eecf5804f034d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(x))=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" /> have? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/e/d8ea42d74287fb95665640e991c92aa37ba2c70f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(200); defaultpen(fontsize(10pt)+linewidth(.8pt)); dotfactor=4;  pair P1=(-7,-4), P2=(-2,6), P3=(0,0), P4=(1,6), P5=(5,-6); real[] xticks={-7,-6,-5,-4,-3,-2,-1,1,2,3,4,5,6}; real[] yticks={-6,-5,-4,-3,-2,-1,1,2,3,4,5,6};  draw(P1--P2--P3--P4--P5);  dot(&quot;(-7, -4)&quot;,P1); dot(&quot;(-2, 6)&quot;,P2,LeftSide); dot(&quot;(1, 6)&quot;,P4); dot(&quot;(5, -6)&quot;,P5);  xaxis(&quot;$x$&quot;,-7.5,7,Ticks(xticks),EndArrow(6)); yaxis(&quot;$y$&quot;,-6.5,7,Ticks(yticks),EndArrow(6)); [/asy]\" width=\"335\" height=\"305\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/7/d/87d2673f4c0ee1e1541c3746b260c7dfe13978c3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) }2 \\qquad \\text{(B) }4 \\qquad \\text{(C) }5 \\qquad \\text{(D) }6 \\qquad \\text{(E) }7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"330\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First of all, note that the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/7/117ad60483f9bf8b2eab1bbe25006ecd064baa09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(t)=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" /> has two solutions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/c/3ec99c15b19905543282aa82b91d7b36b930654c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=-2$\" width=\"53\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/2/cd2a4ec9cf64d68580d5ef68252432965551b464.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"12\" />. \n</p><p>Given an <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/6/8c6bf3c17114c63ae009e88d7162670bee3f7489.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />. Obviously, to have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/8/f282851d0f4f858d95740aaa34eecf5804f034d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(x))=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" />, we need to have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/7/117ad60483f9bf8b2eab1bbe25006ecd064baa09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(t)=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" />, and we already know when that happens. In other words, the solutions to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/8/f282851d0f4f858d95740aaa34eecf5804f034d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(x))=6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"93\" height=\"18\" /> are precisely the solutions to (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/b/66b52d07828a18008054e2764195487583559e7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/4/224ae5ff2e22575ba5a41f26a68c2c5fdc0d502d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />).\n</p><p>Without actually computing the exact values, it is obvious from the graph that the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/b/66b52d07828a18008054e2764195487583559e7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=-2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" /> has two and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/4/224ae5ff2e22575ba5a41f26a68c2c5fdc0d502d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" /> has four different solutions, giving us a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/b/bdb09162ef11ce04fc1d54cb6b03464c134785b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+4=\\boxed{(D)6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"115\" height=\"29\" /> solutions.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/3/653468fb472ce591f7429c348a1f2b68deca3c12.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(200); defaultpen(fontsize(10pt)+linewidth(.8pt)); dotfactor=4;  pair P1=(-7,-4), P2=(-2,6), P3=(0,0), P4=(1,6), P5=(5,-6); real[] xticks={-7,-6,-5,-4,-3,-2,-1,1,2,3,4,5,6}; real[] yticks={-6,-5,-4,-3,-2,-1,1,2,3,4,5,6};  path graph = P1--P2--P3--P4--P5; path line1 = (-7,1)--(6,1); path line2 = (-7,-2)--(6,-2);  draw(graph); draw(line1, red); draw(line2, red);  dot(&quot;(-7, -4)&quot;,P1); dot(&quot;(-2, 6)&quot;,P2,LeftSide); dot(&quot;(1, 6)&quot;,P4); dot(&quot;(5, -6)&quot;,P5); dot(intersectionpoints(graph,line1),red); dot(intersectionpoints(graph,line2),red);  xaxis(&quot;$x$&quot;,-7.5,7,Ticks(xticks),EndArrow(6)); yaxis(&quot;$y$&quot;,-6.5,7,Ticks(yticks),EndArrow(6)); [/asy]\" width=\"335\" height=\"305\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/d9A-UTh07Rc\">https://youtu.be/d9A-UTh07Rc</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A\">2002 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2002 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colsp